<title>USA: DMX says NASDAQ intends to delist stock.</title>
<headline>DMX says NASDAQ intends to delist stock.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>DMX Inc on Thursday said NASDAQ has told the company its stock will be delisted because it does not currently meet capital requirements.</p>
<p>DMX said it expects to appeal NASDAQ's position and anticipates a final determination being made in about 30 days.</p>
<p>It the stock is, DMX said it will immediately begin trading on the over the counter bulletin board.</p>
</text>
